      "description": "Nomori is a calm nonogram puzzle game. Solve logic grids using number clues — no time pressure, no ads, no in-app pestering.\n\n• Today's puzzle delivered daily\n• Sizes from 5×5 to 15×15\n• Easy, Medium, Hard, Expert difficulty\n• Streak heatmap and personal stats\n• Apple Watch companion\n• Light and dark themes\n• Fully offline — your progress stays on your device\n\nDesigned for the moments you want to put your phone on Do Not Disturb but still keep your mind moving. If you like Picross, Griddlers, or Sudoku, you'll feel at home.",
