      "releaseNotes": "Nomori now keeps the silhouettes you've solved. Quietly.\n• Your library — a wall of every puzzle you've finished, ready to revisit.\n• This week — a small canvas of the past seven days on the Stats screen.\n• Quiet hour — discover the time of day you most often play.\n• One quiet reminder, once a day — opt-in, never noisy.",
      "seenAt": "2026-05-26T15:06:16Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.3",
      "releaseNotes": "v1.3 — Anchors\n\nA quieter shape of return.\n\n— Past silhouettes now collect in a quiet wall, reachable in one tap from Today\n— After a longer pause, a small dashed marker waits — no streak shaming\n— Today's mark on your Apple Watch picks a color of its own\n— Your puzzle palette drifts gently with practice — never declared, only felt\n\nNo new buttons. No new counters. Just more anchors for a habit you already have.",
      "seenAt": "2026-05-28T17:26:59Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.3.1",
      "releaseNotes": "A calm new ambient backdrop now drifts gently across the main screen, shifting with the time of day from morning to midday, sunset and night. It is a pure visual refresh, with no changes to how the app works.",
      "seenAt": "2026-06-10T14:09:30Z"
    },
    {
